This directory is a GPL-3.0-or-later add-on to RAVEL.

The files here adapt MCFM 10.2.1 (commit 0adaa4ed4079de1b17c84417a0a428a468f57e69)
and are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option)
any later version. The full license text is in COPYING.GPL-3.txt; attribution is in
ATTRIBUTION.md.

RAVEL itself is Apache-2.0. The add-on is not part of the RAVEL Python package. It is
fetched and built as a separate program by the RAVEL installer, and RAVEL talks to the
built program only through files (a control file, an MCFM input card and the program's
text output). No GPL code is imported into the RAVEL process.
